              "question": "Question 11",
              "solution_html": "<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 my-1 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\"><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">The Vedas are four Rg,Yaju,Sama & Adharva. Vedangas are the last treatises of the</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">Vedic Literature. Vedangas literally means the limbs of the Vedas,it can be regarded as Vedic</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">supplements. Vedangas are divided into 6 classes.They are:-त्शक्षा(Phonetics)व्याकरणिं,(Grammar)</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">छन्दस्(Metre) त्िरुक्तिं(Ethimology)</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">कल्पिं(Religious practice), ज्योत्तषिं (Astronomy).The vedangas, which are the support of the.</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">study,preservation and protection of the Vedas and Vedic traditions.</li></ul>",
              "final_answer": "study,preservation and protection of the Vedas and Vedic traditions",
